---
// src/components/Bienvenidos.astro
---

<section id="bienvenidos" class="py-24 bg-gris-claro overflow-hidden relative">
  <!-- Decorative Background Elements -->
  <div
    class="absolute top-0 right-0 -translate-y-12 translate-x-1/3 w-96 h-96 bg-gris-claro rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none"
  >
  </div>
  <div
    class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 translate-y-1/3 -translate-x-1/3 w-96 h-96 bg-verde/5 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-16 lg:gap-20">
      <!-- Text Content Area -->
      <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 space-y-8">
        <div class="relative">
          <div
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gris-claro text-verde-oscuro text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide mb-6"
          >
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-verde animate-pulse"></span>
            Bienvenidos a <a
              href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL}
              class="flex items-center relative"
            >
              <img
                id="logo-light"
                src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}images/logofondoclaro.png`}
                alt="BIOGREEN Claro"
                class="h-16 sm:h-20 w-auto object-contain transition-opacity duration-500"
              />
            </a>
          </div>

          <h2
            class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-verde-oscuro leading-[1.15] mb-6"
          >
            Creemos en un futuro <br />
            <span
              class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-verde-oscuro to-green-500"
            >
              más limpio y sustentable
            </span>
          </h2>

          <div
            class="space-y-6 text-lg text-verde-oscuro font-light leading-relaxed"
          >
            <p>
              Nos mueve la convicción de que los residuos orgánicos no son un
              problema, sino una oportunidad para <strong
                class="font-medium text-verde-oscuro border-b-2 border-verde-oscuro/20"
                >regenerar el suelo, reducir el impacto ambiental y aportar
                valor a la comunidad.</strong
              >
            </p>
            <p
              class="pl-4 border-l-4 border-verde-oscuro/20 text-verde-oscuro italic"
            >
              Somos una planta de compostaje autorizada, preparada para recibir
              y valorizar residuos orgánicos no peligrosos, con trazabilidad,
              eficiencia y compromiso ambiental.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-8">
            <a
              href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}contacto`}
              class="group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-gris-claro transition-all duration-200 bg-verde border border-transparent rounded-full hover:bg-verde-oscuro text-gris-claro hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:border-verde-oscuro/20"
            >
              Únete al cambio
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 ml-2 -mr-1 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path>
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Image Area -->
      <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 relative">
        <!-- Image Container with Hover Effects -->
        <div
          class="relative group rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl z-10 aspect-[4/3] bg-gris-claro"
        >
          <img
            src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}images/vertical (8).jpg`}
            alt="Maquinaria y proceso de compostaje en BIOGREEN"
            class="object-cover w-full h-full transform transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"
          />
        </div>

        <!-- Decorative Background Frame -->
        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-verde-oscuro to-green-50 rounded-3xl transform translate-x-4 translate-y-4 -z-10"
        >
        </div>
        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 border-2 border-verde-oscuro/20 rounded-3xl transform -translate-x-4 -translate-y-4 -z-10"
        >
        </div>

        <!-- Floating Badge -->
        <div
          class="absolute -bottom-4 left-2 sm:-bottom-6 sm:-left-6 lg:-left-10 bg-gris-claro p-3 lg:p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-verde-oscuro/20 z-20 animate-bounce"
          style="animation-duration: 3s;"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <div
              class="flex-shrink-0 bg-gris-claro p-3 rounded-full text-verde"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-6 h-6"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p
                class="text-sm lg:text-base font-bold text-verde-oscuro leading-tight"
              >
                Planta Autorizada
              </p>
              <p class="text-xs lg:text-sm text-verde-oscuro/60 font-medium tracking-wide">
                100% Trazable
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
